    Large Square Painting x1           <=  Wood x3 + Linen x3 + Oil x3 + Pigment x1                   @24

[metalwork_bench] Metalwork Bench  { category=bench fuel=no electric=no max_level=2 }
  L1:
    Bronze Block x1                    <=  Bronze Ingot x5                                            @8
    Display Cabinet x1                 <=  Black Glass x2 + Iron Ingot x1                             @2
    Gold Block x1                      <=  Gold Ingot x5                                              @-
    Gold Column x2                     <=  Gold Block x1                                              @-
    Gold Stairs x2                     <=  Gold Block x1                                              @-
    Iron Block x1                      <=  Iron Ingot x5                                              @8
    Iron Pot x1                        <=  Iron Ingot x3                                              @-
    Iron Trapdoor x1                   <=  Iron Block x1 + Ladder x1                                  @8
    Magnet x1                          <=  Iron Ingot x1 + Black Sand x1                              @8
    Safe x1                            <=  Iron Ingot x5                                              @8
    Steel Block x1                     <=  Steel Ingot x5                                             @-
    Steel Column x2                    <=  Steel Block x1                                             @-
    Steel Downlight x5                 <=  Oil x1 + Glass x1 + Steel Ingot x1                         @-
    Steel Lantern x5                   <=  Steel Ingot x1 + Glass x1 + Oil x1                         @0.5
    Steel Stairs x2                    <=  Steel Block x1                                             @-
    Steel Uplight x5                   <=  Oil x1 + Glass x1 + Steel Ingot x1                         @-
    Tin Bucket x1                      <=  Tin Ingot x3                                               @8
  L2:
    Copper Wire x5                     <=  Copper Ingot x1                                            @-
    Electric Elevator Motor x1         <=  Steel Block x1 + Electric Motor x1 + Copper Wire x10       @4
    Electric Motor x1                  <=  Steel Ingot x5 + Magnet x1 + Copper Wire x10               @4
    Elevator Shaft x5                  <=  Steel Block x1 + Copper Wire x5                            @4

