    Oil x2                             <=  Flax Seed x1                                               @-
    Red Ochre x1                       <=  Clay x10                                                   @8
    Tin Foil x1                        <=  Tin Ingot x1                                               @2
  L2:
    Clay x10                           <=  Dirt x1 + Bucket of Water x1                               @4
    Copper Blue x1                     <=  Copper Ore x10                                             @4
    Crushed Limestone x5               <=  Limestone x1                                               @-
    Emerald Green x1                   <=  Emerald x1                                                 @8
    Tyrian Purple x1                   <=  Dodo Feather x5                                            @8
    Ultramarine Blue x1                <=  Lapis Lazuli x1                                            @4

[tailors_bench] Tailor's Bench  { category=bench fuel=no electric=no max_level=4 }
